          "settings": {
            "title": "What other supplements work synergistically with this product?",
            "text": "<p>BPC-157, TB-4 Frag and our Bioactive B-Complex all provide a rounded approach to support metabolic health, healthy inflammation response, tissue recovery and  optimizing overall wellness.</p>"
